answer:
If your online card payment didn't go through, you can try the following steps:
- Check your card details are correct and try again;
- Make sure there’s enough money in the account you’re paying from;
- Try again with a different card;
- If you have a Revolut account, try purchasing crypto from the 'Crypto' section using your account balance.
If the issue persists, please reach out to us for further assistance.

If your kid's card payment didn't work, you can try the following steps:
- Check the card details are correct and try again;
- Ensure there's enough money in the account;
- Check if 3DS authentication is working correctly;
- If the issue persists, consider ordering a replacement card in the app.

If your bank says you set up a payment thing wrong, you can try the following steps:
- Check your card details are correct and try again;
- Check if 3DS authentication is working correctly or showing up in your banking app;
- Make sure there’s enough money in the account you’re paying from;
- Try setting up the payment again with the correct details.
If the issue persists, please reach out to us for further assistance.
